// Flauta Cavaquinho E Violao
// A nice CHORO song. I play it a bit on the slow side. And as a Rhumba :)
// NOTE: The score I have is in 2/4 ... our groove is
//       in 4/4. So, careful on truncated bars, etc.

Tempo 110
Keysig F

Groove Metronome2-4
   z * 2
   
Groove RhumbaIntro
Begin AllGrooves Chord
    Voice NylonGuitar
    Volume +20%
End

Seq 4
Truncate 2
0         z

Label DC
Groove Rhumba
Cresc p mf 4

1        Gm
2        Dm
3        A7
4        D7

Groove RhumbaSus
Volume mf

5        Gm      /     A7
6        Dm
7        Bb      /     A7

If Def FINE
  Goto FINE
Endif

8        Dm

LABEL DS

Groove Rhumba1
Cresc mp mf 4

9        Dm
10        /
11        /
12       A7

Groove Rhumba1Sus
Decresc m 4

13        /
14        /
15        /
16       Dm

Groove Rhumba
Volume f

17        /
18        /
19       D7
20       Gm

Groove RhumbaSus
Volume m

21       D7
22       Gm
23       A7

If Def Coda
  Goto CODA
Endif

24       Dm

Groove Rhumba3
Cresc mp f 4

25        F      /      E
26       Gm      /     C7
27       Gm      /     C7
28        F

Groove Rhumba3Sus
Volume m

29       A7
30       Dm
31       G9
32       C7

Groove RhumbaTriple
Volume ff

33        F      /  Fdim7
Groove Rhumba
34       C7
Groove RhumbaTriple
35        F      / F#dim7
Groove Rhumba
36       C7

Groove RhumbaSus
Volume m

37       F7
38       Bb
39       A7
40       D7

Groove Rhumba
Decresc mp 4

41      Gm7      /     A7
42       Dm
43       E7      /     A7
44       Dm

Set CODA
Goto DS
Label  CODA
Groove RhumbaEnd1
Cresc f 1
45       Dm  /   z  Dm

Set FINE
Goto DC
Label FINE
Groove RhumbaEnd
Volume ff
46       Dm  / / z!@3.5

